      "summary": "Entry-point script for KV cache data generation: runs forward passes on a language model while intercepting attention tensors via hooks, then saves the resulting Q/K/V tensors and generated tokens to disk (and optionally S3) for downstream RL training.",
      "tags": ["entry-point", "data-pipeline", "service"],
      "complexity": "complex"
    },
    {
      "id": "class:src/kvcompression/entrypoints/datagen/unroll_and_store.py:InferenceRecipe",
